'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Story chapters|story chapter]] in ''[[Escape from Tarkov]]''.

==Description==
{{quote|During the raid on the office, some kind of special weapon went off on one of the roofs... I remember a bright blue flash before I blacked out. After that, all the electronics failed. I've never encountered such a powerful EMP weapon before. I need to find out what technology hit the city, and who's behind it.}}

==Requirements==
Pick up and read [[EMERCOM leaflet]] or [[Note by Item 1156|Note by Item #1156]] from one of the following locations:
* Inside a green shipping container at the Scav base/EMERCOM camp on [[Woods]]
