==Objectives==
* Talk to [[Mechanic]] about the EMP blast
** (''Optional'') Gain access to [[Mechanic]]
* Locate and obtain the [[Unknown device fragment|device fragment]]
* Hand over the [[Unknown device fragment|device fragment]] to [[Mechanic]]
* Plant the [[Local network hacking device|hacking device]] in the server room in [[the Lab]]
* Talk to [[Mechanic]]
* Keep the [[Unknown device fragment|fragment of Item 1156]] for yourself or hand it over to [[Mechanic]]
* Find a [[Note mentioning Item 1156|lead on Item 1156]]  
* [[Rus Post audio tape 11.05 / 003|Investigate]] the Rus Post office
* Locate the [[Rus Post car key|Rus Post Car]]
* Obtain the [[Item 1156 specification|blueprint for Item 1156]]

==Guide==
===Talk to [[Mechanic]] about the EMP blast===
Visit [[Mechanic]] in the menu through the trader screen and ask him about the EMP blast.

